    <string name="sing_sound_help">Quality renders with BigVGAN, the singing decoder: cleanest on held notes, and the slowest (on the GPU here). Turbo renders with Vocos, the speech decoder: much faster, with some harmonic artefacts on sustained notes in some voices.</string>
